        "\n",
        "**Research Focus:** Improving Text Description Quality through LSTM Temporal Modeling & Semantic Tag Embeddings\n",
        "\n",
        "## Research Questions Addressed:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Baseline lacks temporal modeling and semantic grounding\n",
        "2. 2-Layer LSTM + 84-tag semantic embeddings\n",
        "3. LSTM+Tags improve text quality (lower perplexity, higher BLEU)\n",
        "4. 4 frames → predict 5th description (better quality)\n",
        "5. 10-20% perplexity ↓, 50-100% BLEU ↑\n",
        "6. Video-level holdout (no leakage)\n",
